# Files that end up inside a Linux container must keep LF even when the
# repository is checked out on Windows. Otherwise git rewrites them to
# CRLF, COPY carries that into the image, and the shell treats the CR as
# part of the command: the entrypoint failed with
# "invalid format: 'app:app\r'" while the build itself looked fine.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
